        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"24b722a3-4d0d-485d-badd-f78fe3d973a1\",\"review_text\":\"See the power of islam sweden\"},{\"review_id\":\"8e813c3b-cc3f-4d3a-9f2c-780aec9943ce\",\"review_text\":\"amazing\"},{\"review_id\":\"e8c4c351-75af-42e7-b9b6-8cdfa847cea1\",\"review_text\":\"Ok\"},{\"review_id\":\"6ec0f0af-8be2-4d49-97fc-091c274cc473\",\"review_text\":\"Too many ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"60249aab-75ea-452e-911e-1628379f01b1\",\"review_text\":\"I updated the software and Spotify being Spotify it also removed the widget. Tried to add it back but it's not there anymore. There is only this laughable huge widget that fills huge portion of my screen. Not being able to adjust the height of the widget is unbelievable design decision. Poweramp has smaller widget and it shows more information. Amazing.\"},{\"review_id\":\"9483215d-f162-4f30-b042-ba6dfccc5616\",\"review_text\":\"taktahu\"},{\"review_id\":\"34c44e26-6097-44d2-b22d-fbd408348d33\",\"review_text\":\"My favorite app\"},{\"review_id\":\"3b03d8d3-738f-439d-9bfc-4a4709437c68\",\"review_text\":\"Very good 👍🏿\"},{\"review_id\":\"55ca2253-6b70-49d9-9e0a-104b08d1eaab\",\"review_text\":\"Worst app ever...i purchased premium duo twice to listen song with my friends.. In mobile app it show your package is active and in web it say no package purchase.. are you guys high or what? If you want free money just beg. Don't make stupid app's or just for once fix the issues.\"},{\"review_id\":\"626017ae-7c8a-4f89-976f-008df5296fda\",\"review_text\":\"Everything is paid now lol 😂\"}]}"
